BETA_NUMBER

  × An underscore in a number must sit between two digits.
   ╭─[test.mori:1:12]
 1 │ const n = 1__000;
   ·            ┬
   ·            ╰── this underscore
   ╰────
  help: Underscores group digits, like `1_000_000` or `0.000_001`.
